Summary of key classes used:
LocalDate: Date without time or time zone (e.g., YYYY-MM-DD).

LocalTime: Time without date or time zone (e.g., HH:mm:ss).

LocalDateTime: Date and time without time zone offset.

ZonedDateTime: Full date and time with a specific ZoneId.

Instant: High-precision UTC timestamp for machine logs.

Period: Measures distance in date units (years, months, days).

Duration: Measures distance in time units (hours, minutes, seconds).

DateTimeFormatter: Formats dates/times to String or parses strings to date objects.